[I] Additional Image Format plugins for Qt5

[T] Qt Image Formats provides additional image format plugins for Qt 5, such
[T] as TIFF, WebP, MNG, TGA, WBMP and ICNS, extending the formats supported
[T] by QImage out of the box.

